+-class MultiEmbDataLoader:
+-    """
+-    Dataloader that handles:
+-    1. Reading text chunks from Parquet (in-memory, fast enough for 7M strings).
+-    2. Zero-copy / mmap loading of 4 massive .npy embedding files.
